      "content": "Certainly, here's a revised and clearer version of your recipe draft:\n\n---\n\n**Spinach Creamy Garlic Sauce Recipe**\n\n1. Preheat a pan over medium heat and melt some butter in it.\n2. Add chopped onions to the pan, and cook until they become soft.\n3. Stir in minced garlic and let it cook until fragrant.\n4. Pour in heavy cream along with a pinch of salt and pepper, then stir well.\n5. Let the sauce gently simmer for a few minutes to thicken slightly.\n6. Finally, toss in freshly washed spinach until it wilts.\n7. Serve your creamy garlic sauce over warm pasta.\n\nEnjoy your delicious meal!\n\n---\n\nThis version should satisfy the automated \"thoroughness check\" while keeping it both user-friendly and readable. Let me know if there is anything else you'd like to adjust!",
